                        "entry_id": "c71fb3af-4aa0-318b-868a-fd8fd98abca6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of упря́мец (uprjámec): female obstinate person"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fce0c96c-992f-40cd-8758-0cadf61470b5",
                                "sense_id": "4d0d4750-acd5-3f82-902e-7bbd44ba53a8",
                                "text": "Вчера́ я был сча́стлив, чрезме́рно сча́стлив, доне́льзя сча́стлив! Вы хоть раз в жи́зни, упря́мица, меня́ послу́шались.",
                                "translation": "I was happy yesterday, immensely happy, impossibly happy! For once in your life, you obstinate person, you obeyed me.",
                                "english": "I was happy yesterday, immensely happy, impossibly happy! For once in your life, you obstinate person, you obeyed me."
                            }
                        ]
